{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"EZK","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"以西結書","commonName":"以西結書","title":"以西結書","order":26,"numberOfChapters":48,"sha256":"12baf83f738d213fc8fcfdfb80ed9077bac361d38fc0165824d98cb7b59e53b9","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/EZK/1.json","lastChapterNumber":48,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/EZK/48.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1270},"chapter":{"number":15,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["葡萄樹的比喻"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["耶和華的話臨到我說："]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["「人子啊，葡萄樹比別樣樹有甚麼強處？葡萄枝比眾樹枝有甚麼好處？"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["其上可以取木料做甚麼工用，可以取來做釘子掛甚麼器皿嗎？"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["看哪，已經拋在火中當作柴燒，火既燒了兩頭，中間也被燒了，還有益於工用嗎？"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["完全的時候尚且不合乎甚麼工用，何況被火燒壞，還能合乎甚麼工用嗎？」"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["所以，主耶和華如此說：「眾樹以內的葡萄樹，我怎樣使它在火中當柴，也必照樣待耶路撒冷的居民。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["我必向他們變臉；他們雖從火中出來，火卻要燒滅他們。我向他們變臉的時候，你們就知道我是耶和華。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["我必使地土荒涼，因為他們行事干犯我。這是主耶和華說的。」"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/EZK/15.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/EZK/16.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/EZK/14.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":8}